# Security Audit Report

**Project:** IOTA Wallet Website (React SPA + Cloudflare Pages Functions)  
**Date:** May 31, 2026  
**Status:** Complete

---

## Executive Summary
A comprehensive security review was conducted on the IOTA Wallet Pro website, covering front-end React components, build-time configurations, and backend Cloudflare Pages Functions. 

No critical vulnerabilities (e.g., exposed private keys, credential leaks, or active DOM-based XSS) were found. However, several weaknesses of Medium and Low severity were identified, primarily concerning rate limiting and input size constraints in the API, and missing security headers on the static hosting environment.

